  "description": "IronOCR.Android is an advanced OCR library for C# and .NET, supporting cross-platform applications like MAUI and Avalonia.\n\nIt provides Tesseract OCR on Android for:\n* .NET 9\n* .NET 8\n* .NET 7\n* MAUI for Android\n* Avalonia for Android\n\nIronOCR reads Text from all major image formats using the latest Tesseract 5 engine. This library adds OCR functionality to mobile applications in minutes.\n\nIronOCR's Unique Features:\n* Pure .NET OCR API\n* All OCR tasks run locally (no SAAS)\n* Corrects low quality, noisy and distorted scans\n* Performance tuned above and beyond any other known build of Tesseract OCR.\n* Reads multi-page TIFFs\n* Can save any OCR Scan to XHTML\n\nData output options include: Plain Text and an OCR Result class containing paragraphs, lines, words, and characters.\n\nLanguage Support: English.\n\nLicensing & Support available for commercial deployments. Email: support@ironsoftware.com\n\nFor code examples, documentation & more visit http://ironsoftware.com/csharp/ocr/",
